---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy - SnapImg</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for SnapImg. Learn how our client-side processing guarantees your data privacy." />
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased">

  <nav class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-xl tracking-tight text-white">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-sm">⚡</span>
        Snap<span class="text-blue-500">Img</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-800/40">
        ← Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex-1 w-full space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. Zero Server-Side Processing (GDPR & CCPA Compliant)</h2>
      <p>
        At <strong>SnapImg</strong>, we believe privacy is a fundamental human right. Unlike traditional online converters, all image conversion and compression operations are conducted strictly <strong>client-side</strong> using the HTML5 Canvas API in your browser memory.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your images, metadata, and files are <strong>never uploaded, transferred, or stored</strong> on any external servers or third-party storage. Once you close your browser tab, all temporary data in memory is instantly cleared.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Log Files & Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Like most websites, we may utilize standard web analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics) to analyze trends, administer the site, and track general aggregate metrics (such as page views and geographic country). These analytics do not contain personally identifiable information (PII) and are fully anonymized.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. Third-Party Advertising & Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We may partner with third-party advertising networks (including Google AdSense and advertising networks) to serve ads when you visit our website. These companies may use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this or other websites. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting your browser's cookie settings or <a href="https://aboutads.info" class="text-blue-400 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">4. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, feel free to reach out to us at <code class="text-blue-400">mocharies85@gmail.com</code>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
    <p>© 2026 SnapImg. Part of the Curiolot Network.</p>
  </footer>
<!-- Cloudflare Web Analytics --><script type='module' src='https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js' data-cf-beacon='{"token": "41f00d160e5c4a60934351c9c834ac5d"}'></script><!-- End Cloudflare Web Analytics -->
</body>
</html>